# Never commit game data
*.gbc
*.gb
*.sav
*.state
rom/
build/
work/
**/tools/gbemu-cli/
__pycache__/
*.bps
*.ips
# Exception (owner's decision 2026-11-12): test save files made by a project's tools, documented in <project>/saves/README.md
!*/saves/*.sav
# Exception (owner's decision 2026-11-15): saves the gamedb agents made while playing, documented in
# gamedb/games/<slug>/saves/README.md (downloaded saves stay in gamedb/rom/saves/, ignored)
!gamedb/games/*/saves/*.sav
!gamedb/games/*/saves/*.state
